and side-effect gating.'}, {'file': 'rtl/mem_stage.sv', 'description': 'Use the registered effective address for the request and RVFI memory fields. Select the final load or arithmetic result before MEM/WB and retain its payload across a dmem hold.'}, {'file': 'rtl/wb_stage.sv', 'description': 'Pass the selected registered result directly to the regfile and forwarding path. Retain valid-qualified register writes.'}, {'file': 'rtl/div_unit.sv', 'description': 'Implement the byte prefix and six parallel radix-16 digits. Keep signed corner cases, the eight-edge transfer, held-result behavior, and the ALTOPS substitute formulas.'}, {'file': 'test/test_div_unit.py', 'description': 'Keep the arithmetic, exact-latency, and deferred-acceptance assertions. Exercise quotient and remainder around the 15/16 and 255/256 prefix cutoffs and around exact divisor multiples.'}, {'file': 'test/test_pipeline.py', 'description': 'Exercise a subword address with a forwarded base and negative offset through a dmem hold. Check byte lanes, stable request payload, RVFI memory fields, and forwarding from a held MEM/WB value.'}], 'outcome': 'improvement', 'fitness': 171.57, 'delta_pct': 11.88, 'vs_baseline': 1315.59, 'fmax_mhz': 74.008, 'ipc_coremark': 2e-06, 'cycles': 4313521, 'iterations': 10, 'lut4': 4894, 'ff': 890, 'seeds': [73.755, 74.008, 74.008], 'perturbations': [[0, 73.755, 15], [1, 74.008, 15], [2, 74.008, 15]], 'lutram': 88, 'bsram': 4, 'dsp': 5, 'critical_path': {'from': 'cpu/u_ex/u_div/divisor_q_19_s0', 'to': 'cpu/u_ex/u_div/partial_remainder_q_5_s0', 'slack_ns': -8.558, 'arrival_ns': 18.853, 'logic_cells': 19, 'modules': ['clock_ibuf', 'cpu/u_ex/u_div']}, 'logic_levels': 15, 'formal_passed': True, 'cosim_passed': True, 'error': None, 'timestamp': '2026-11-20T05:09:39.449301Z', 'slot': 0, 'round_id': 5, 'lesson': '- 2026-11-20 hyp-20261120-001-r5s0 (improvement, +11.88%): Selecting the load or EX result before MEM/WB removes the writeback mux from the EX forwarding path, and holding the registered value, destination, and forwarding enable across dmem stalls while clearing retirement valid lets a stalled consumer forward from a producer that has already retired without adding a bubble.'}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
