ify carry across the upper word,\\nproducer traps, consecutive pairs, and recovery with both buses\\nstalled using the ordinary single-retirement correctness gates.\\n\", \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 5, \"confidence\": \"low\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/hazard_unit.sv\", \"description\": \"Bypass the lo\n…[2022 of 5094 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:bc3cd164216526c1]…\n, \"fmax_mhz\": 86.822, \"ipc_coremark\": 3e-06, \"cycles\": 3294730, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 6316, \"ff\": 994, \"seeds\": [86.306, 86.822, 86.822], \"perturbations\": [[0, 86.306, 13], [1, 86.822, 12], [2, 86.822, 12]], \"lutram\": 161, \"bsram\": 6, \"dsp\": 5, \"critical_path\": {\"from\": \"cpu/u_id/alu_rs2_sel_2_s0\", \"to\": \"cpu/u_ex/reg_q.alu_result_26_s0\", \"slack_ns\": -6.587, \"arrival_ns\": 16.881, \"logic_cells\": 35, \"modules\": [\"clock_ibuf\", \"cpu/u_ex\", \"cpu/u_ex/u_alu\", \"cpu/u_ex\"]}, \"logic_levels\": 13, \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-20T19:35:13.902003Z\", \"slot\": 0, \"round_id\": 15, \"lesson\": \"- 2026-11-20 hyp-20261120-001-r15s0 (regression, +0.28%): Raw-lane BEQ/BNE equality and parallel carry for `LW`-dependent loads at offsets 0\\u20133 cut stalled CoreMark cycles by 5.57%, with the ID/EX `rs1` forwarding select through the divider\\u2019s first quotient digit capping median Gowin Fmax at 86.822 MHz, below the 90.56 MHz needed for promotion.\"}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
