nd bits. Use parallel 35-bit differences to select the greatest divisor multiple without borrow, including zero, and produce the next remainder and quotient digit. Finish with a registered sign correction and quotient or remainder selection. Signed division truncates toward zero and signed remainder follows the dividend sign. Return the RV32M-defined values on divisor zero and INT_MIN divided by -1.\\n\\nHold fetch and ID/EX while the divide is outstanding \n…[15634 of 18706 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:83f026b166371354]…\nescription\": \"Elaborate the divider with the core. Exercise a load feeding a divide and a consumer of the divide immediately after it under bus stalls. Check forwarded operands, RVFI values and contiguous order, and that an older store is accepted only once.\\n\"}], \"outcome\": \"regression\", \"fitness\": 97.34, \"delta_pct\": 703.14, \"vs_baseline\": 703.14, \"fmax_mhz\": 43.722, \"ipc_coremark\": 2e-06, \"cycles\": 4491485, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 2773, \"ff\": 566, \"seeds\": [40.783, 43.722, 43.722], \"perturbations\": [[0, 40.783, 23], [1, 43.722, 36], [2, 43.722, 36]], \"lutram\": 8, \"bsram\": 6, \"dsp\": 6, \"critical_path\": {\"from\": \"cpu/u_rf/regs_regs_0_0_s0\", \"to\": \"cpu/u_id/id_ex_w.rs2_val_0_s100\", \"slack_ns\": -19.52, \"arrival_ns\": 29.814, \"logic_cells\": 52, \"modules\": [\"clock_ibuf\", \"cpu/u_id\", \"cpu/u_ex\", \"cpu/u_if\", \"cpu/u_hazard\", \"cpu/u_id\"]}, \"logic_levels\": 23, \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-20T02:49:52.575313Z\", \"slot\": 1, \"round_id\": 1}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
