al to the pre-NRET=2 baseline.\n6:[depth]\n7:# BMC depth per check. 2nd column (where present) is the k-induction prove\n8:# depth. Keep depths matched to the current pipeline so bugs within ~20\n18:# liveness — CPU makes forward progress under any symbolic stream\n22:liveness   1 10 20\n/srv/hwebench/toolchain/oss-cad-suite/bin/verilator\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
